{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026SyUQWnDPf81793600427.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>大埔龍尾村蔡天鳳肢解案續審。</p><p></p><p>三名被告，包括蔡天鳳前夫鄺港智、前家翁鄺球和前大伯鄺港傑否認一項謀殺罪，但先後承認阻止合法埋葬屍體罪。</p><p></p><p>蔡天鳳於2023年2月21日遇害，庭上繼續播放閉路電視片段，見到鄺球在案發前四日，到深水埗選購二手雪櫃，店員幫他將雪櫃搬上車尾廂，鄺球期間曾拉低口罩吸煙。同日晚上鄺球及鄺港傑，分別駕駛私家車到龍尾村案發單位。陪審團又在庭上傳閱涉案的保鮮紙，控方指上面有蔡天鳳的DNA。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T07:41:06.903499+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":201,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T04:57:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T04:38:39.557127+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T07:38:29.283506+00:00","content_hash":"d0f92d47136348ea0808dcbe94dfbe04b3c6bc436ee4ac1f573824156ee4467a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T07:41:06.903499+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}